<body>
<script>
  const target = new Date('2026-10-24T09:00:00+01:00').getTime();
  function updateCountdown() {
    const now = Date.now(); const diff = Math.max(0, target - now);
    ['cd-days','cd-hours','cd-mins','cd-secs'].forEach((id, i) => {
      const v = [Math.floor(diff/86400000), Math.floor((diff/3600000)%24), Math.floor((diff/60000)%60), Math.floor((diff/1000)%60)][i];
      const el = document.getElementById(id); if (el) el.textContent = String(v).padStart(2, '0');
    });
  }
  updateCountdown(); setInterval(updateCountdown, 1000);
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-fade]').forEach(el => {
    new IntersectionObserver((e,o) => { e.forEach(x => { if (x.isIntersecting) { x.target.classList.add('is-visible'); o.unobserve(x.target); } }); }, { threshold: 0.12 }).observe(el);
  });
setTimeout(function(){document.querySelectorAll("[data-fade]:not(.is-visible)").forEach(function(e){e.classList.add("is-visible")})},1500);
</script>

<article class="page">
  <div class="pt-flag"></div>
  <header class="hdr">
    <div class="hdr-inner">
      <a href="/en/"><img src="/logo.png" class="logo" alt="MAGColor"></a>
      <nav class="nav">
        <a href="/en/" class="nav-item active">Home</a>
        <a href="/en/ponentes" class="nav-item">Speakers</a>
        <a href="/en/programa" class="nav-item">Program</a>
        <a href="/en/entradas" class="nav-item">Tickets</a>
        <a href="/en/patrocinadores" class="nav-item">Sponsors</a>
<a href="/en/faq" class="nav-item">FAQ</a>
      </nav>
      <button class="hamburger" onclick="this.parentElement.querySelector(`.nav`).classList.toggle(`open`)"><span></span></button>
<div class="hdr-right">
        <div class="lang">
        <button data-lang="pt" class="lang-pill">PT</button>
        <button data-lang="es" class="lang-pill">ES</button>
        <button data-lang="en" class="lang-pill active">EN</button>
      </div>
        <a href="/en/entradas" class="btn btn-gold btn-sm">Reserve My Spot</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="hero" id="top">
    <div class="hero-bg"></div>
    <div class="hero-inner" data-fade>
      <div class="badge-gold">FIRST EDITION · LISBON 2026</div>
      <h1 class="hero-title"><span class="grad">MAGColor Experience</span><span class="hero-sub-title">Lisbon 2026</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-desc">The official launch of MAG Color in Europe. An intensive experience for professionals who want to raise their standards, connect with references from Brazil, Portugal and Spain and play at another level. Event with simultaneous Portuguese-Spanish translation.</p>
      <div class="countdown">
        <div class="cd-box"><div class="cd-num" id="cd-days">00</div><div class="cd-lbl">Days</div></div>
        <div class="cd-box"><div class="cd-num" id="cd-hours">00</div><div class="cd-lbl">Hrs</div></div>
        <div class="cd-box"><div class="cd-num" id="cd-mins">00</div><div class="cd-lbl">Min</div></div>
        <div class="cd-box"><div class="cd-num" id="cd-secs">00</div><div class="cd-lbl">Sec</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-date">October 24 & 25, 2026</div>
      <div class="hero-place">HF Fénix Lisbon Hotel · Portugal</div>
      <div class="badge-soft">Championship · International Judges</div>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a href="/en/entradas" class="btn btn-gold">Reserve My Spot</a>
        <a href="/en/entradas" class="btn btn-outline">View Ticket Options</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-fine">Limited spots · Basic, Gold & Divine VIP</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec"><div class="wrap" data-fade><div class="grid-2"><div class="card row"><span class="big-num">01</span><div><h3 class="card-title">2 days of event</h3><p class="card-desc">Training, lectures, demos and networking in Lisbon.</p></div></div><div class="card row"><span class="big-num">02</span><div><h3 class="card-title">Professional Championship</h3><p class="card-desc">Hair by hair, Powder Brows & Lips categories with international judges. Prizes for 1st and 2nd place.</p></div></div><div class="card row"><span class="big-num">03</span><div><h3 class="card-title">White Gala Dinner</h3><p class="card-desc">Dinner, certificates, trophies and recognition.</p></div></div><div class="card row"><span class="big-num">04</span><div><h3 class="card-title">Divine VIP</h3><p class="card-desc">Only 10 spots with private dinner, accommodation & exclusive experience.</p></div></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="sec alt" style="position:relative">
    <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;opacity:0.20;pointer-events:none;overflow:hidden">
      <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/cejas.jpg" alt="" style="width:33.33%;height:100%;object-fit:cover">
      <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/ojos.jpg" alt="" style="width:33.34%;height:100%;object-fit:cover">
      <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/labios.jpg" alt="" style="width:33.33%;height:100%;object-fit:cover">
    </div>
    <div class="wrap" data-fade style="position:relative;z-index:1"><div class="center-block">
    <div class="badge">FIRST EDITION</div>
    <h2 class="h2">The official entry of MAG Color into Europe</h2>
    <p class="lede">This is the first edition of MAGColor Experience Lisbon. A gathering created to mark MAG Color's official entry into Europe and bring together professionals who want to elevate their technical level, broaden their vision and be part of a new international micropigmentation community.</p>
    <a href="/en/entradas" class="btn btn-gold">Be Part of the First Edition</a>
  </div></div></section>

  <section class="sec"><div class="wrap" data-fade>
    <div class="center-block" style="margin-bottom:48px"><div class="badge">WHY ATTEND</div><h2 class="h2">An experience that can mark a before and after in your career</h2><p class="sub-tert">If you are a micropigmentation artist, PMU professional, trainer or advanced aesthetics specialist who wants to grow within the premium beauty industry, this event is for you.</p></div>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="card row"><span class="big-num">01</span><div><h3 class="card-title">Advanced Technique</h3><p class="card-desc">Learn from international professionals who work with precision and an updated vision of aesthetic, capillary and paramedical micropigmentation.</p></div></div>
      <div class="card row"><span class="big-num">02</span><div><h3 class="card-title">Professional Prestige</h3><p class="card-desc">Experience an event where competition, international judges, trophies and the gala transform the experience into real recognition.</p></div></div>
      <div class="card row"><span class="big-num">03</span><div><h3 class="card-title">International Networking</h3><p class="card-desc">Connect with artists, trainers, speakers, judges and brands from Brazil, Portugal and Spain who share your level of commitment.</p></div></div>
      <div class="card row"><span class="big-num">04</span><div><h3 class="card-title">Business Vision</h3><p class="card-desc">Broaden your professional vision, elevate your positioning and understand how to grow in an increasingly competitive industry.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap" data-fade><div class="grid-split">
    <div>
      <div class="badge">ARTISTIC DIRECTION</div><h2 class="h2">Under the direction of Miriam Alcántara</h2><p style="margin-top:8px"><a href="https://www.instagram.com/institutomiriamalcantara/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;color:var(--gold);font-size:.9rem"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/ig-logo.png" alt="Instagram" style="width:22px;height:22px">@institutomiriamalcantara</a></p>
      <p class="body">Miriam Alcántara is one of the most recognized international references in advanced and paramedical micropigmentation in Europe. With over 30 years of experience, she has trained more than 30,000 students, establishing herself as a mentor, trainer and opinion leader in the industry. Specialized in aesthetic, capillary and paramedical micropigmentation, she works with high-level clinics and medical centers developing areola reconstruction treatments, scars and advanced solutions for oncological and aesthetic patients.</p>
      <div class="quote">"Her vision goes beyond teaching a technique: she leads a movement to transform micropigmentation artists into more solid, visible and recognized professionals within premium beauty."</div>
      <div class="stats"><div class="stat"><div class="stat-num">+30</div><div class="stat-lbl">years of experience</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="stat-num">+30,000</div><div class="stat-lbl">students trained</div></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="miriam-photo"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/assets/speakers/miriam-alcantara.jpg" alt="Miriam Alcántara" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:20px"></div>
  </div></div></section>

