      <div class="card center speaker"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/assets/speakers/bianca-tostes-v2.jpg" class="avatar" alt="Bianca Tostes" style="object-fit:cover"><p class="sp-name">Bianca Tostes</p><p class="sp-spec">Microblading</p></div>
